  "pack": {
    "pack_format": 15,
    "description": "PillagersPlus brings a fresh and challenging experience to Minecraft by expanding the vanilla raid system with unique pillager types and intense raid waves. Featuring special enemies like Summoners, Royal Guards, Mages, and Bombardiers, the mod demands players to adopt new strategies and tactics during raids. It also introduces new biomes, castles, and diverse pillager outposts, offering exciting exploration and valuable loot. Compatible with Forge and NeoForge, PillagersPlus runs smoothly on multiplayer servers and enriches gameplay without compromising vanilla balance. Perfect for players seeking deeper, more dynamic raids and tougher challenges, this mod enhances both solo and cooperative play with immersive content and improved AI behavior."
  }
